# Pointing at the wheel's weapons (Wheel pick: Point, the default; a tester's ask, 0.1.17) with its slow motion: the hand stays
# where it is and only turns, the ray going round the wheel's eight icons in turn. [vr-ring] lines say each slot and item, and
# the time slowing and coming back. Run with QUEST_SIM_GIVE of eight weapons or more.
600 y 1
606 y 0
3000 shot before
3100 right_click 1
3160 shot open
# The wheel's next page has more of them on it.
3170 right_trigger 1
3176 right_trigger 0
# Top, then round to the right: the hand's yaw and pitch for each icon, from where the hand is (xr_sim's 0.2 right, 0.35 down),
# the right hand's wheel being right of the middle.
# 0.1.18: the wheel opens at the hand, its middle at 399, 298 of the canvas for this hand (it was 399, 207), so the pitches are 10.7 to
# 11.8 lower than 0.1.17's; the yaws are as they were.
3200 hand_yaw -11.7
3201 hand_pitch 12.8
3260 shot top
3280 hand_yaw -19.0
3281 hand_pitch 9.7
3340 shot topright
3360 hand_yaw -21.9
3361 hand_pitch 3.2
3420 shot right
